================================================================================
1. OVERVIEW
================================================================================

screenwall_generator.py generates flat pattern DXF files for perforated aluminum
screenwall panels with sheet metal J and L flanges. The Streamlit app accepts a
CSV of panel specs and returns a ZIP of DXF files, one per panel.

Dependencies: ezdxf, csv, math, os (stdlib)
Entry point:  generate_panel_dxf(spec: PanelSpec, outdir: str)
CSV parser:   parse_csv(path: str) -> list[PanelSpec]


